// Copy to nr.local.json and fill in. That file is gitignored.
// A password left out — "" or absent — is asked for at the prompt and not stored.
//
// The url is what a BROWSER reaches, through the proxy: host plus the path it
// routes on. It is not admin_root. admin_root in registry.yml is what the
// runtime itself serves, and the deploy on the target host uses that against
// the container. The two can differ — a proxy path is not proof of the
// runtime's own root — so do not copy one into the other. Across this estate
// they happen to match: each runtime serves its own prefix.
//
// Where each instance answers: docs/runbook.md, 'Reaching an instance from a
// workstation'. Where the url and admin_root overlap, the tools strip the
// duplicate and say so.
{
  "cho-prod": {
    "url": "http://cho-svr-lin01/node-red-prod",
    "user": "admin",
    "password": ""
  },
  "cho-test": {
    "url": "http://cho-svr-lin01/node-red-test",
    "user": "admin",
    "password": ""
  },
